<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="b553a16b">&lt;p&gt;
    Test script execution may be automatically or manually performed. Automated test execution is usually programmable
    which may lead to&amp;nbsp;faster and more reliable results. In comparison, manual testing is often slower and less
    reliable due to&amp;nbsp;increased likelihood of human error. However, manual testing is more likely to find real user
    issues and therefore, end users may prefer to perform manual testing. Automated testing is considered cost effective
    but sometimes tools can be expensive too.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
